Without validating the destination_domain , there is a risk that malicious actors may invoke the
deposit_for_burn instruction with arbitrary destination domains, even if those domains are not
intended for the EVM . This may result in unintended transfers of USDC to destinations other than the
EVM address.

Remediation

Add a validation step in authorize to ensure that the destination_domain parameter matches the
expected domain for EVM transfers.

