funds right before the nft_resolve_payout_ft receipt is processed.

The reason for the affected scenario being limited is due to NEAR distributing parts of transaction fees to
contracts as developer incentives, and reception of fees for any single transaction is likely able to cover
the fee amount required for ft_transfer to succeed.



