OS-SUI-ADV-03 [high] | Bypass Id Leak Verifier

Description

id_leak_verifier in sui-verifier ensures the non-reusability of a UID for the Sui Object. This
step of the verifier guarantees that the id field of Sui objects never becomes leaked. However, bypass of
these checks may occur utilizing the unique Sui upgrade model. This issue arises due to the following
factors:

